 "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Ref - SPT Friendly Quests</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>NOTE: Deletion may not be possible because this mod adds quests. You may need to start a new profile.\nIf you insist on removing it, you can do the following.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-reffriendlyquests</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">RECOMMENDED MODS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Recommended Mods:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sp-mod.com/mod/1089/kaeno-traderscrolling\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kaeno-TraderScrolling</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sp-mod.com/mod/1539/bosses-have-lega-medals\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bosses Have Lega Medals</a></p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
